<title>USA: Partnership cuts MFB Corp stake.</title>
<headline>Partnership cuts MFB Corp stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaSalle/Kross Partners L.P. said Tuesday it reduced its stake in MFB Corp to 0.3 percent or 5,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the partnership said it sold 126,700 shares of MFB back to the company on October 22 at $18.75 a share.</p>
<p>The group said it has agreed not to nominate any candidates for election to the board of MFB and not to introduce any proposed business at the 1997 annual meeting of stockholders.</p>
</text>
